// title: A creature you can fight
// about: An infectious creature with its encounter and what happens on a win or a loss.
// kind: creature
// order: 10
// step: The creature
// question: name|Name|name|
// question: picture|Picture (optional)|image?|
// question: area|Where is it met?|zone||The area the creature roams in. Make a new one if there is none yet.
// question: strength|How dangerous is it?|choice:weak,even,strong|even|Sets its level, health and damage. Change the numbers later in its details.
// step: Its body
// question: form|Which body does it give?|form||Winning or losing against it can mutate the player toward this body form.
// step: The encounter
// question: opening|When the player meets it|prose|A creature approaches.
// question: win|If the player wins|prose|You emerge victorious.
// question: lose|If the player loses|prose|The creature has won.
== creature {{id}}
name: {{name}}
image: {{picture}}
found in: {{area}}
level: {{level}}
hp: {{hp}}
damage: {{damage}}
form: {{form}}
encounter:
    -> {{id}}_encounter
defeated:
    -> {{id}}_win
victory:
    -> {{id}}_lose
== scene {{id}}_encounter
{{opening}}
== scene {{id}}_win
{{win}}
== scene {{id}}_lose
{{lose}}
